  "summary": "A busy kids' bunk-room aboard a space station, drawn from eye level with a gentle wide-angle bow. Grab-rails, coiled ropes and cargo nets crowd the ceiling and upper walls; a bunk bed, two blinking control consoles, a shelving unit stacked with crates and hoses, a round night-sky porthole, a storage bench and a vault-style airlock door line the mid-ground; and a round table on an orange rug, a small plant table, a wooden workbench with clamps, stacked crates and knee-high yellow safety railings crowd the foreground floor.",
